# Layout Fix Verification Checklist

- [ ] Navigate to http://localhost:3000/
- [ ] Check if `.overlay-panel` and `.timeline-bar` are positioned relatively to the canvas (absolute positioning).
- [ ] Verify `.timeline-bar` is centered at the bottom.
- [ ] Verify `.overlay-panel` is at the top-left (absolute top-6 left-6).
- [ ] Check if `backdrop-blur-2xl` and `bg-[#0f0f12]/60` are being applied.
- [ ] Take a screenshot of the fixed UI.
- [ ] Return the status.
